{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spacebar is an endless side-scrolling platformer that can be played with just your spacebar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are practice levels that allow you to practice playing through all the patterns you may encounter in the main mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An endless jump stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An endless fly stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An endless gravity flipping stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finite practice versions for each of the stages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599040/extras/jump.gif?t=1742829443\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599040/extras/flip.gif?t=1742829443\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599040/extras/fly.gif?t=1742829443\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599040?t=1742829443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599040?t=1742829443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599040/e4605063e6259700f5f540686ac2ffbed13364b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742829443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599040/e4605063e6259700f5f540686ac2ffbed13364b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742829443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spacebar is an endless side-scrolling platformer that can be played with just your spacebar!</p><p class=\"bb_pa